## 1. Project Overview
KZN Collectibles & TCG is a specialized hobby retail outlet in Pietermaritzburg. This repository contains the semantic HTML5 web platform designed to present the shop's product catalogue, facilitate weekly tournament registrations, and manage customer card sourcing enquiries.

## 2. Website Goals & Key Performance Indicators (KPIs)
* Digitize inventory to achieve 1,800+ monthly catalogue views.
* Automate event registrations to capture 45+ tournament signups monthly.
* Provide clear physical location and contact access for both retail branches.

## 3. Sitemap & Page Structure
* `index.html`: Hero banner, latest expansion arrivals, and tournament alerts.
* `about.html`: Origin story, community standards, and staff directory.
* `products.html`: Categorised listings of sealed cards, accessories, and games.
* `enquiry.html`: Dual-purpose form for tournament RSVPs and card sourcing.
* `contact.html`: Multi-branch details (PMB Flagship & Hilton Express) with feedback forms.

## 4. Part 1 Implementation Details
* Formatted strictly using valid HTML5 semantic layout tags (`<header>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<section>`, `<article>`, `<aside>`, `<footer>`, `<fieldset>`).
* Fully linked cross-page relative navigation on all 5 web pages.
* Integrated descriptive inline developer comments for code clarity.
* Structured root directory structure (`css/`, `js/`, `images/`).

